Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ tense music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's settle the score, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,WELCOME HOME\NYOZAKURA FAMILY RESURRECTION PARTY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,\Nlet's get this sibling fight started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You just barely managed not to pass out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.77,0:00:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty well trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kengo] Don't give me\Nthat "well trained" crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're brainwashed, and yet you were still\Nworried enough about us to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're bringing you home\Neven if we have to drag you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you asshole Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.41,0:00:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.67,0:00:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kengo] {\i1}Listen up, Taiyo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's only one key{\i0}\N{\i1}to saving Big Bro Shinzo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.97,0:01:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,for me to touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way brainwashing that powerful\Ncould be reversed by a drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can just manage to touch him,\NI'll find a way to do it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}Gotcha.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to do whatever it takes{\i0}\N{\i1}to give Kengo a chance to touch him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.57,0:01:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kengo] {\i1}But you need to be super careful.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.03,0:01:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because Big Bro's Blooming...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is Destruction.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter who takes him on,{\i0}\N{\i1}he can destroy them just like that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[Shinzo] {\i1}Kengo's got a weak neck,{\i0}\N{\i1}so this will bring him down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.21,0:01:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Actually, if I did it any harder,{\i0}\N{\i1}it would blast his head off.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kengo] {\i1}If I try to attack him head-on,{\i0}\N{\i1}he'll take me out with one blow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So on the other hand...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can counter that first blow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.02,0:01:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[Shinzo] {\i1}So they switched places{\i0}\N{\i1}the instant they were hurled back?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.11,0:01:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your Blooming is Assimilation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.49,0:01:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're probably planning{\i0}\N{\i1}to do something by reading my mind.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:02:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the only way{\i0}\N{\i1}you two can hope to beat me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.99,0:02:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not the only ones\Nwho can make countermoves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,One false move, and you'll break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sit tight, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.21,0:02:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts frustratedly]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hardening's a great type of Blooming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.85,0:02:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's still room for improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.69,0:02:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[Shinzo] {\i1}Glad I was able to somehow{\i0}\N{\i1}stop short of destroying them both.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.37,0:02:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks for buying me\Nall that time, Taiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My entire stock of dolls,\Na thousand of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll more or less break\Nif I use them, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm offering them up to you, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.58,0:02:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[Shinzo] A prosthetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kengo] Let's go!\NHere's my maximum output transformation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:03:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mega Kengo Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.48,0:03:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ opening theme song playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}MISSION 45\NYOZAKURA FAMILY FEUD
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[Shinzo] {\i1}I've been ejected from the ship!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kengo]\N{\i1}It's hard to move around underwater.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're stunned and tense.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:04:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We did all this to get to this moment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just you wait, Big Bro.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.84,0:05:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're taking you home now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My Blooming, Assimilation, isn't just{\i0}\N{\i1}about entering someone's memories.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.31,0:05:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With direct contact,{\i0}\N{\i1}I can share my own memories too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.73,0:05:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those brainwashed memories of yours...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}watch me fix them with real memories.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm starting to see{\i0}\N{\i1}inside your mind, Big Bro.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.63,0:05:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The mind is stuffed{\i0}\N{\i1}with all kinds of sparkly memories.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the secret room{\i0}\N{\i1}that no one but you can enter.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I'm the only one...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}who can enter another person's mind.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So dark!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my way, Kengo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.56,0:06:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to go back there soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the time when I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.45,0:06:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kengo] {\i1}Only the memories that would serve{\i0}\N{\i1}Dad's purposes have been left,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}while the most recent ones{\i0}\N{\i1}have been redacted wholesale.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How does this all work?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[Shinzo] Even Dad couldn't erase\Nmy most undesirable memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember the day\Nthat I first achieved Blooming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,At least, I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But the scent of blood and the screaming,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,they're still stuck in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.23,0:06:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[Momo] {\i1}It's scary{\i0}\N{\i1}not to have any memories, isn't it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know that feeling well myself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[young Shinzo] {\i1}You do, Dad?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know nothing about my own past.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.69,0:06:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where I was born, where I was raised,{\i0}\N{\i1}I can't recall a single thing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At first, I was mystified by Rei{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.95,0:06:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for embracing an unknown entity like me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I can understand why now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if you can't love yourself{\i0}\N{\i1}because you don't know who you are,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know you so well, Shinzo...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.09,0:07:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I love you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ wistful music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.51,0:07:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have seen it that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I'd picked up on the signs\NDad was giving that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I'd listened to him more\Nor had tried to look into his past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I'd been able\Nto do something more for Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,then Mom and Mutsumi never would have had\Nto go through that ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But my own fear kept getting in my way,\Nand I could do nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always so consumed by my own problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-[smacks]\N-Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know we're all underwater now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.43,0:07:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't want this to drag on too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always like that, Kengo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:07:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So dry and cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can never understand\Nhow a klutz like me feels!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.31,0:08:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you inside out, Big Bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,how klutzy you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and how super cool you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You may not remember this yourself,\Nbut I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what triggered your Blooming?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,When I nearly got killed\Non a solo mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you came to my aid and awakened...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,so that you could protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Big Bro.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[young Shinzo] {\i1}Kengo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.76,0:08:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank goodness.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're all right!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ wistful music continues playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.35,0:08:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Big Bro! Big Bro!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kengo] I figured you'd want to forget\Nabout that, so I kept it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.53,0:08:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,for me, it's an important, crucial memory\Nthat I never want to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanting to forget the painful stuff,\Nwallowing in your favorite memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no harm in that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The powerful side of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The fun side of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The sweet side of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[Shinzo] {\i1}Are Kengo's memories{\i0}\N{\i1}pouring into my mind?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kengo] See, your mind\Nisn't pitch-dark like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, it's stuffed\Nwith the best memories ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.19,0:09:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you can't recall them yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kengo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Big Bro.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:10:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}He's starting to come back!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kengo] {\i1}If I can fill in{\i0}\N{\i1}the missing parts,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I bet it'll reverse the brainwashing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ music fades]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[Momo] Nice try, Kengo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Blooming is magnificent...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but you're not the only one{\i0}\N{\i1}who can enter someone's mind.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kengo] {\i1}Not again!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.09,0:10:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo] {\i1}He's running out of air!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[inhales sharply]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Kengo?\N-My bad. Don't talk to me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how he's doing it,\Nbut the old man's power is blocking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all I can do to resist it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.32,0:11:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't figure this out, we're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to do something about Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, good job capturing Shinzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave the rest to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that's how it is, Futaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some business with Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only going to say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.22,0:11:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ powerful music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.59,0:11:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[debris clattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:11:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[Nanao grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.05,0:12:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[beeps]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[drones humming]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[Nanao gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[Futaba] Would you mind\Nnot destroying this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just settle down for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.61,0:12:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinking Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[Nanao grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.79,0:12:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to stop me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have to activate\Nyour Blooming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If I do that,\NI'll end up dragging you all into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only going to use my Blooming\Non that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In the first place,\Nit's not my place to step in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately for me,\NI have a lot of competent siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shion, Nanao...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:13:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,two back-line fighters like you\Nare going to take me on in close combat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[Nanao] An aiki technique\Nthat utilizes the surrounding forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Cascading Kumite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Essentially, it's the same\Nas our application
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,of science and information.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you're crazy strong, Big Sis,\Nbut you're a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Better not let your guard down...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,since we happen to be smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,\Nlet's start this training session.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.26,0:13:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one of us siblings\Nhas ever seen through you, Big Sis Futaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be an uphill battle for us,\Nhuh, Big Sis Shion?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[Shion] {\i1}Yeah,{\i0}\N{\i1}it's a horrible game for sure.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But not an unbeatable one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Infinite verification and collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The steps to clear the game\Nhave always been the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.45,0:13:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can also guess your play style.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left for me to do\Nis the analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't burn up\Nyour brain cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.37,0:14:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro, you'd better step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree. You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I have no clue\Nwhat you can do at max effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.51,0:14:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[Futaba] {\i1}Most likely, that's poison gas.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.48,0:14:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[Nanao] Big Sis Futaba,\Nyour Blooming is Magnanimity,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,enveloping everything,\Nthen nullifying them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,At this time, there's no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm having my body\Ncontinuously adapt,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so that I can surpass you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.95,0:14:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This entire room is my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.45,0:14:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to release\Nan infinite stream of poison gas,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,which you're going to absorb infinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see whose Blooming\Ncan hold out longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Nanao. How manly of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[exclaims]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.05,0:14:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A blight-spider neurotoxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,One whiff can stop\Neven Big Bro Kyoichiro in his tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:15:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep evolving\Nuntil it reaches you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[gas hissing]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[Momo] The kids are fighting each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so desperately for the family's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Rei...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[breathing raggedly]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's not...\N-[flesh squelches]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[Nanao breathing unevenly]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.61,0:15:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The crystallization's taking longer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.74,0:15:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Better not overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.66,0:15:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry to say\Nthat my cells don't know when to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[Futaba gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you before that this whole room\Nis now my body, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The stronger you are, Big Sis,\Nthe stronger I'll become, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.35,0:16:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed, Nanao.\NYou can change form at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.87,0:16:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter how much you transform,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you have a shape,\Nyou can never slip through my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be too sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Analysis complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Nanao.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I deliver checkmate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[drones buzzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You can transform\Nor multiply all you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and nothing will change!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're switching places effortlessly...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but there's one{\i0}\N{\i1}that's constantly keeping its distance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Kumite\Ncan convert anything into force,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but it can't use\Nsomething that doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,By adding some nonexistent entities\Ninto the mix,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,we're sure to find an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[Futaba] {\i1}I can't tell the actual you{\i0}\N{\i1}from the fakes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that makes no difference.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.94,0:17:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All the force absorbed{\i0}\N{\i1}by my Magnanimity throughout this battle{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is in my grasp at full strength.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment you exchanged blows with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you lost your path to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Spring Gale!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[Shion] {\i1}Hmm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[Futaba] {\i1}Shion? What are you doing here?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't move!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.55,0:19:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,First Gale of Spring is a small typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.64,0:19:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason your body\Ndoesn't get tossed away
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,is because you're standing\Nin the windless "eye of the storm."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was hiding all along{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}by having the drones{\i0}\N{\i1}map the scenery onto my body.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nanao's flamboyant attacks were all a ruse{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to make my optical camouflage{\i0}\N{\i1}less obvious.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then I waited for you{\i0}\N{\i1}to give us an opening{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}by obliterating Nanao's technique.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All so that...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I could hold you in my arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,just like Mom did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ mellow music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.22,0:19:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No one could handle you\Nwhen you were throwing a tantrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,When Dad tried to contain you,\Nhe'd usually get blasted to kingdom come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.19,0:19:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hate you, Dad!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:20:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[Shion] But for some reason,\NMom was the only one...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[young Futaba] I said let me go, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoichiro stained my book\Nwith potato chip grease!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Munch, munch.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm going to stain his room\Nwith his own blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give Kyoichiro\Nwhat he's got coming to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.63,0:20:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,so just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[young Kyoichiro laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Come back here!\N-Don't mess with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[young Futaba]\NWhy can't I escape your arms, Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.98,0:20:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,when I can blast away everyone else\Njust like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a total mystery to me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe because I've stopped your fights\Nthousands of times?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Make that tens of thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I used to get flung away, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.20,0:20:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But after going through that{\i0}\N{\i1}over and over and over...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think I've gotten{\i0}\N{\i1}the hang of it somehow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a secret about you\Nthat only I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,which makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.51,0:21:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NWhat a sorry sight you are, Futaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.55,0:21:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.47,0:21:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoichiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Big Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The angle and strength of the arms\Nacross your extensor muscles...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,how she shifted her center of gravity,\Nthe proximity of her body...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.95,0:21:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I analyzed every single memory\Nto replicate it with 100% accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,These are Mom's arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.33,0:21:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ mellow music continues playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[Futaba exclaims softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.83,0:21:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't remind me of things\Nthat I'd rather forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, head back to the Sumomo Plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps receding]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to see Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ ominous music playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.03,0:22:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[all gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.46,0:22:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[Taiyo gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪ ending theme song playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.11,0:24:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE\NDREAMS

